{
    "title": "Dribble Hoops",
    "description": "Dunking,  ankle breakers, crossovers, and all the cool stuff you enjoy at your fingertip!\r\n\r\nDribble hoops is the first person basketball experience you were waiting for.\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY:\r\n + Drag your finger to move.\r\n + Release to jump, Tap to shoot.\r\n + Tap inside the dunking zone to dunk.\r\n + Tap in the right spot to Power Dunk!\r\n + Score high and level up your skills.\r\n\r\nDribble hoops starts easy so anyone can play,\r\nand master all the skills.\r\nThe AI evolves overtime so be ready for a\r\nchallenge.\r\n\r\nCheck out all the bonus levels for even more fun:\r\n\r\n + Long shots\r\n + Trick shots\r\n + Shots in a row\r\n\r\n... and cool new features are added all the time!\r\nGet it now and have fun !!!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Dunking,  ankle breakers, crossovers, and all the cool stuff you enjoy at your fingertip!<br><br>Dribble hoops is the first person basketball experience you were waiting for.<br><br>HOW TO PLAY:<br> + Drag your finger to move.<br> + Release to jump, Tap to shoot.<br> + Tap inside the dunking zone to dunk.<br> + Tap in the right spot to Power Dunk!<br> + Score high and level up your skills.<br><br>Dribble hoops starts easy so anyone can play,<br>and master all the skills.<br>The AI evolves overtime so be ready for a<br>challenge.<br><br>Check out all the bonus levels for even more fun:<br><br> + Long shots<br> + Trick shots<br> + Shots in a row<br><br>... and cool new features are added all the time!<br>Get it now and have fun !!!",
